#ddev-generated
# NOT INSTALLED any more, and deliberately so.
#
# The DDEV project root is now the TYPO3 Core clone itself, so the .gitignore
# there is Core's own tracked file. Writing to it would put the add-on's paths
# into every Gerrit patch. .git/info/exclude does the same job, is local to the
# clone, is never committed, and is shared by every worktree — see
# ensure_core_excludes() in functions.sh and the matching install.yaml action.
#
# Kept as a file so an upgrade from an older payload does not leave a stale copy
# behind with entries that no longer describe the layout.
